# Generated review output + per-project state. The config (config.json,
# config.schema.json) stays tracked; everything below is produced at run time.
# Patterns are scoped to the dir so they do NOT case-insensitively swallow
# commands/review.md on macOS/Windows.
.adversarial-code-review/review-*/
.adversarial-code-review/worktrees/
.adversarial-code-review/cache/
.adversarial-code-review/learnings.json
.adversarial-code-review/last-review.json
.adversarial-code-review/posted-comments.json

# WS9 migration: the plugin dir was named `.adverserial-code-review` (typo) before this release;
# ignore its state the same way in case it's still around unmigrated.
.adverserial-code-review/review-*/
.adverserial-code-review/worktrees/
.adverserial-code-review/cache/
